{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13366","headline":"东峰亭各赋一物得寒溪草 · 苏寓","name":"东峰亭各赋一物得寒溪草","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幂䍥溪边草，游人不厌看。\n余芳幽处老，深色望中寒。\n幸得陪情兴，青青赏未阑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏寓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}